<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-ALBANIA 1 ARMENIA 1 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ALBANIA 1 ARMENIA 1 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania and Armenia drew 1-1 in their World Cup European group nine qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: </p>
<p>Albania - Bajram Fraholli 58</p>
<p>Armania - Hakob Ter-Petrosyan 90</p>
</text>
